{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning the alarm clock kills me. This is a short visual novel about anxiety, cyclicity, and trying to wake up when it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a hero. You're just not sleeping. Because you know: As soon as you close your eyes, it will ring again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm. Not just a device. He's alive. And he's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What else awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister comedy on the verge of sleep and madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrealism Parade: milk with eyes, a talking refrigerator and a twin reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visual presentation \u2014 images only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack, disturbing sounds and loop feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement for hugging the alarm clock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where time is the enemy, and every morning is a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you set your alarm for 07:00 yet? He was waiting for you too.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078030?t=1760778336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078030?t=1760778336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078030/9956ea32bf103dc45acfb39cec019e2d0d0a681a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760778336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078030/9956ea32bf103dc45acfb39cec019e2d0d0a681a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760778336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning the alarm clock kills me. This is a short visual novel about anxiety, cyclicity, and trying to wake up when it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a hero. You're just not sleeping. Because you know: As soon as you close your eyes, it will ring again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarm. Not just a device. He's alive. And he's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What else awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister comedy on the verge of sleep and madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrealism Parade: milk with eyes, a talking refrigerator and a twin reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visual presentation \u2014 images only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack, disturbing sounds and loop feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement for hugging the alarm clock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where time is the enemy, and every morning is a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you set your alarm for 07:00 yet? He was waiting for you too.</p>","developers":["Total","Gamesforfarm"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078030/6b96cf633a131212b0c847b0ab135c8cbb85c0bb/header.jpg?t=1760778336","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078030/1762134219/3638f1ef2906a7a3f66ca96f44ff08625166c869/1759312990/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760776802","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078030/1762134219/3638f1ef2906a7a3f66ca96f44ff08625166c869/1759312990/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760776802","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.